From: Aurora contributors <noreply@aurora-silicon.org>
Subject: [PROTOTYPE] sandbox: admit numbered stateless M2M decoder pairs on Linux

BSD-3-Clause. Target: Chromium 156.0.8078.79. AI-assisted implementation.
The actual discovery helper is compiled with mocked OS calls by check-prototype.py.
Full browser compile and hardware/security qualification remain required.

